  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Other - 14th U.S.-China Oil and Gas Industry Forum, through Citigroup, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This obligation covered registration fees for three USTDA participants in the 14th U.S.-China Oil &amp; Gas Industry Forum (OGIF), an annual, bilateral public-private partnership connecting leaders in business and government from the oil and natural gas industries of the United States and China. OGIF provides unique opportunities for U.S. officials and enterprises, as well as their Chinese counterparts to facilitate open dialogue in areas of mutual interest, including technology, market development, and the role of government with the aim of enhancing the secure, economical, and reliable production and delivery of oil and natural gas supplies. USTDAs Director participated in the Plenary Session and gave opening remarks.</narrative>
  </description>
